# Title: Disable Or Stop Services
# ID: de25eeb8-3655-4643-ac3a-b662d3f26b6b
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-09-15
# Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685, attack.impact, attack.t1489
# Description: Detects the usage of utilities such as 'systemctl', 'service'...etc to stop or disable tools and services on Linux systems.
# Attackers may stop or disable security tools and services to evade detection, maintain persistence, or disrupt system operations.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((process.executable:*/service OR process.executable:*/systemctl OR process.executable:*/chkconfig) AND (process.command_line:* stop * OR process.command_line:* disable *)) AND NOT (((process.executable:*/systemctl AND (process.command_line:*--no-reload disable snap-snapd-* OR process.command_line:* stop snap-snapd-*)) OR (process.executable:*/systemctl AND process.parent.command_line:*tmp.ci/preinst upgrade* AND (process.command_line:* stop * AND process.command_line:*ssh.*)) OR (process.parent.command_line:*/dpkg/info/ubuntu-pro-client.prerm upgrade* AND process.executable:*/systemctl))) AND NOT ((process.executable:*/systemctl AND process.command_line:*snap.amazon-ssm-agent.amazon-ssm-agent.service)))
